<title>USA: Merit Behavioral Q1 Dec 31 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Merit Behavioral Q1 Dec 31 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>PARK RIDGE, N.J. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net	   loss	$2,872     loss	$6,956</p>
<p> Revs		     128,625		  110,920</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name Merit Behavioral Care Corp.</p>
<p>1995 Q1 loss includes $3,972,000 in merger costs, $985,000 in income tax benefits, and $1,012,000 for cumulative effect of accounting change for deferred contract start-up costs, net of a tax benefit of $757,000.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 loss includes benefit for income taxes of $219,000.</p>
